Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.94,0:00:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Every time the rain no longer\Nfalls and I see the sky?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.40,0:00:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I think back to when I was a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.36,0:00:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Who could only cry?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.02,0:00:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Blindly chasing after him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.70,0:00:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I fell far behind my only thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.40,0:00:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,One day I will be stronger!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.50,0:00:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Bridery and gratitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.98,0:00:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Fading with the wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.60,0:00:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I stronger now than I was before?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.44,0:00:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Or as weak as back then?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.46,0:00:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.50,0:01:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,But until I do, my voyage will not end.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.24,0:01:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what's next, I'm\Nwalking straight ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.06,0:01:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's go, there's nothing\Nthat can stop us now!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.66,0:01:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Though time's all on our side,\Nwe'll never let it pull us down.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.16,0:01:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,And we may fall, but we'll\Nalways keep on standing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.66,0:01:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way anything will take\Nwhat I hold dear away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.82,0:01:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The voices inside me push\Nme to keep surviving.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.74,0:01:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go on. I'll get through.\NNo matter what, I gotta do.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.34,0:01:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The fiercest of the ball can pour upon me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.26,0:01:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care why in the\Nworld would I turn back.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.22,0:01:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.32,0:01:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing that can stop us now!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.98,0:02:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Though time's not on our side.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.26,0:02:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll never let it pull us down.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.92,0:02:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,And we may fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.00,0:02:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,But we'll always keep on standing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.90,0:02:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way anything will take\Nwhat I hope, dear, away from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.16,0:02:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I know the future's there for us to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.74,0:02:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a Tsunami!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.44,0:02:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that is power!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.26,0:02:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,He's straight out of hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.26,0:03:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,My sage!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.06,0:03:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Aokiji.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.38,0:03:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, you little squirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.26,0:03:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,He froze it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.26,0:03:31.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Artisan!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.84,0:03:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The whole bay is iced over.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.40,0:04:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,The ship's locked in.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.62,0:04:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't even move.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.78,0:04:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,All cannons open fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.40,0:04:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Save the moving dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.38,0:04:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Well let's move.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.68,0:04:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We got something to stand on now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.54,0:04:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's show them what we can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.70,0:04:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Gentlemen, we've got\Nthe commander's backing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.84,0:04:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,us up to open fire and\Ngive them everything. If
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.78,0:04:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.08,0:04:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,not
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.99,0:04:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,mistaken
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.91,0:04:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,that's the fifth
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.82,0:04:42.65,Default,,0,0,0,,division commander flower sword vista?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.26,0:04:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep on your toes, Tashigi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.28,0:04:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The commanders aren't the only\Nones we've got to worry about here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.44,0:04:59.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Every one of these SOBs is a\Nmighty soldier in his own right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.64,0:05:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes, thank you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.60,0:05:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,This ice in the water ain't half bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.58,0:05:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice of him to set up some\Nstationary targets for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.02,0:05:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's finish these ships off.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.70,0:05:17.35,Default,,0,0,0,,So we can invade the island!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.26,0:05:23.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm not sure it's\Ngonna be that easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.54,0:05:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,They're sending out the\NVice-Admirals of Navy HQ.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.34,0:05:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a rare sight to see them\Nall lined up in a row like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.68,0:05:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Ain't that cute?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.34,0:05:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like they rolled out\Na Buster Call to Greedus.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.04,0:05:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.12,0:05:43.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Because this time we're\Nthe ones doing the busting,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.32,0:05:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,as they're all about to find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.64,0:05:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Tsuru, why don't you stand back some?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.38,0:05:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, please, just leave this\Nnonsense up to us. Besides,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.54,0:05:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,there's no place safe now, even if I\Nswam all the way to the end of the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.56,0:06:02.09,Default,,0,0,0,,We're setting anchor\Nhere on the ice, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.30,0:06:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to crush those Navy sissies.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.94,0:06:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Now push for solid ground. Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.26,0:06:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We're happy to give our lives for Pops.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.56,0:06:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It'd be an honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.68,0:06:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring it on, Navy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.60,0:06:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,My men got nothing to fear.\NEnough talks. Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.20,0:06:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Scored Pirates! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.46,0:06:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, it all begins.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.80,0:06:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna grace them\Nwith your sword for once.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.20,0:07:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.60,0:07:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Pumps! No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.18,0:07:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.80,0:07:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.46,0:07:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! Ah! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.12,0:07:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.92,0:07:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That's insane!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.84,0:07:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,He blocked the world's greatest swordsman
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.36,0:07:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,third division commander diamond Geoise.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.42,0:08:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,If we want to stop this\Nparty before they wreck.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.64,0:08:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,the place we simply need\Nto remove the head of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.24,0:08:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,This unruly behemoth.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.18,0:08:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Kizaru!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.10,0:08:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yasakani's sacred jewel.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.86,0:08:33.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too bright.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.77,0:08:35.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you tone it down a little, pal?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.94,0:08:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,He just stopped the admiral's\Nattack, but how I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.38,0:09:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It's almost like he's got wings.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.04,0:09:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh we'll fancy that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.84,0:09:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The king's off limits.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.40,0:09:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to reach him
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.72,0:09:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,you gotta go through me first.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.54,0:09:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Scary, these Whitebeards play\Nrough. What the he's on fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.50,0:09:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,He took Kizaru's attack's hat on and he's
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.00,0:09:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,just floating there i\Ndon't know what kind of
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.94,0:09:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,devil print that is but\Ni don't like it even
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.66,0:09:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,more rare than logia\Npowers zoventyte mythical.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.96,0:09:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,creatures. Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.54,0:09:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,His wounds are healing!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.88,0:09:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This can't be real.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.72,0:09:47.37,Default,,0,0,0,,That didn't hurt him at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.26,0:09:50.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it did.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.82,0:09:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't lie to protect my pride.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.26,0:10:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,So that must be the\Nfirst division commander
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.70,0:10:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,if his flames can't turn\Naway an attack then.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.70,0:10:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,They can heal him when it's\Ndone Marco the Phoenix.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.74,0:10:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at that lovely bird\Nit must be quite rare.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.20,0:10:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Well that's quite the painful kick.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.36,0:10:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you're lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.12,0:10:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Kizaru!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.26,0:11:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, giant unit, keep an\Neye on the sky from now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.86,0:11:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, crap, here come the giants.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.00,0:11:08.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone knock them down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.68,0:11:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack their feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.86,0:11:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Out of the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.36,0:11:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Clear a path.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.80,0:11:14.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Geoise.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.60,0:11:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he breaking the ice?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.16,0:11:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.66,0:11:44.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm dry blocking this one!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.28,0:11:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gonna crush us!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.74,0:11:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't outrun it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.92,0:11:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn those two.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.76,0:12:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Cocky hotheads.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.94,0:12:06.23,Default,,0,0,0,,What were they thinking\Nabandoning their post like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.08,0:12:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What if I had done the same, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.62,0:12:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,There'd be no one here to do their job.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.36,0:12:25.19,Default,,0,0,0,,RADIRUPTURE!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.14,0:12:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,He didn't just crush that block of ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.96,0:12:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,He evaporated it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.76,0:12:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Right into thin air!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.82,0:12:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,VOLCANIC RUN!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.30,0:13:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,There's too many of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.58,0:13:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Goddammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.10,0:13:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The ship has been hit!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.92,0:13:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, back away!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.26,0:13:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel like we're watching\Nthe apocalypse unfold here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.90,0:13:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure like to be flashy, don't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.70,0:13:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, think I'll have you light the candles\Nfor my next birthday, you magma punk.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.58,0:14:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd rather provide the\Nlighting for your funeral.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.40,0:14:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,How about it old man?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.14,0:14:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't fall back!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.48,0:14:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Now fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.60,0:14:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,PUSH ON!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.34,0:14:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.54,0:14:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Get to the plaza!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.24,0:15:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Take out the commanders at all costs!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.06,0:15:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let him get ashore!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.68,0:15:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Seek the Moby Dick!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.42,0:15:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Push forward and aim for Whitebeard!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.94,0:15:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,My knees are frozen!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.80,0:15:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.30,0:15:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's pointless.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.20,0:15:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,These guys would slaughter\Nus without a second glance!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.60,0:15:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, you realize that, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.70,0:15:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Just look around you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.16,0:15:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,They're monsters, vultures.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.28,0:15:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,There's not a single thing amateurs\Nlike us can do against guys like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.74,0:15:42.21,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got to run if we want to live, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.92,0:15:43.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.66,0:15:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, don't be an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.32,0:15:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no but, do you understand me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.58,0:15:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,The only thing we can\Ncontribute to this battle is
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.62,0:15:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,more blood for those killers\Nto spill over the ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.48,0:15:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Just listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.64,0:15:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to become an admiral, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.04,0:16:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,There's too much left for us to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.02,0:16:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We're the chosen ones, but Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.84,0:16:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I made a promise to him didn't I
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.48,0:16:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What now? Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.02,0:16:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Here he comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.02,0:17:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.06,0:17:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.78,0:17:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, break down\Ntheir artillery defense!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.72,0:17:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.82,0:17:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,my
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.24,0:17:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.62,0:17:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Brothers!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.72,0:17:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Nicely done!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.74,0:17:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Get up, Little Oars Junior!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.46,0:17:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,He must be related to\Nthe continent, Polar.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.42,0:17:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,He's enormous.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.80,0:17:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,At least twice as big as\None of the regular giants.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.96,0:17:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't let him invade\Nthe island, no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.74,0:18:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll give them too much\Nleverage in the fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.44,0:18:03.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.98,0:18:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Just look at that beautiful beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.26,0:18:09.61,Default,,0,0,0,,And I didn't even know that\NOars had a living descendant.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.00,0:18:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I want it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.98,0:18:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I call his corpse after the battle.
